            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "modals-t2-s04",
          "c": "佢好似唔肯幫手，但係我唔知點解。",
          "j": "keoi5 hou2 ci5 m4 hang2 bong1 sau2, daan6 hai6 ngo5 m4 ji1 dim2 gaai2.",
          "e": "She doesn't seem willing to help, but I don't know why.",
          "note": "好似 (hou2 ci5) hedges an observation. 唔肯 (m4 hang2) is stronger than 唔想 (m4 soeng2): 唔想 (m4 soeng2) means don't feel like it; 唔肯 (m4 hang2) means actively refuse to.",
          "bd": [
