              "j": "man6 haa5",
              "e": "ask"
            },
            {
              "c": "唔使",
              "j": "m4 sai2",
              "e": "no need to"
            },
            {
              "c": "扮識",
              "j": "ban6 sik1",
              "e": "pretend to know how"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "modals-t2-s06",
          "c": "我實會學識㗎，唔該你耐心教我。",
          "j": "ngo5 sat6 wui5 hok6 sik1 gaa3, m4 goi1 nei5 naai6 sam1 gaau3 ngo5.",
          "e": "I'll definitely learn it — please be patient teaching me.",
          "note": "學識 (hok6 sik1) is a result-complement — 學 (hok6) learn + 識 (sik1) know how, meaning successfully acquire a skill. 實 (sat6) at the front gives confident emphasis: definitely will.",
