              "j": "naai6 sam1",
              "e": "patiently"
            },
            {
              "c": "教我",
              "j": "gaau3 ngo5",
              "e": "teach me"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sid": "modals-t2-s07",
          "c": "你肯唔肯試吓？唔識都冇問題㗎。",
